; note figure on beach""}","{""reported_elevation_m"": null, ""reported_depth_m"": null, ""reported_datum"": null, ""reported_uncertainty_m"": null}","{""raw_raster_value_m"": 3.0, ""applied_correction_m"": null, ""derived_elevation_m"": 3.0, ""derived_depth_m"": null, ""derivation_notes"": ""Elevation sampled from SRTM15+V2 at inferred coordinates because source elevation was not reported. Treat this as approximate spatial context, not a surveyed sample elevation.""}","[{""method"": ""other"", ""relation"": ""unknown"", ""age_ka"": null, ""uncertainty_ka"": null, ""material"": null, ""notes"": ""No direct age model extracted from page OCR block.""}]",3,3,3,3
