fa4895d160db9b3a662641e772332c1a6fcd795d3e8111b00741b86a7a4d076d,walis_v1_0_post_review,sea_level_indicator,North coast of East Timor Subau - Manatuto (Subao TII) - MIS 5e - Subau - Manatuto (Subao TII) - MIS 5e,RSL_3645@row3006,-8.4788,125.935575,reported,0.31588879622953314,17.04,MSL,reported,coral_reef,Coral reef terrace (general definition),"[-1.195, -0.885]",128.992,u_series,Coral reef terrace (general definition); Terrace inner margin. The terrace is primarily composed of growth position coral patches on the western exposure and a more uniform reef complex to the east; most coral has been highly altered.,"North coast of East Timor Subau - Manatuto (Subao TII) - MIS 5e, Subau - Manatuto (Subao TII) - MIS 5e, N/A, East Timor","Cox, 2009 Maxwell et al., 2021",https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5979520,1.0,"WALIS quality RSL=5, age=2. Originally accepted=Yes; accepted by other study=N/A. Elevation source: Paleo RSL (m). WALIS reported age. Originally reported ID: Sub-33. Analysis ID: CO09-013-001. WALIS U-series ID: 2965. Record Created by: Kathrine Maxwell. Last Update: 2021-02-28 13:57:52.","{""page"": null, ""figure"": null, ""table"": ""WALIS Summary.csv"", ""section"": ""RSL_3645@row3006"", ""quote_or_paraphrase"": ""WALIS row RSL_3645: Sea Level Indicator; Coral reef terrace (general definition); elevation 16.0 m; paleo RSL 17.04 m; dating U-Series.""}","{""reported_elevation_m"": 16.0, ""reported_depth_m"": null, ""reported_datum"": ""Mean Sea Level / General definition"", ""reported_uncertainty_m"": 0.52}","{""raw_raster_value_m"": null, ""applied_correction_m"": null, ""derived_elevation_m"": 17.04, ""derived_depth_m"": null, ""derivation_notes"": ""WALIS Paleo RSL used as LITTORAL analytical elevation when available; measured indicator elevation preserved as reported observation.""}","[{""method"": ""u_series"", ""relation"": ""equal"", ""age_ka"": 128.992, ""uncertainty_ka"": 0.8907, ""material"": ""Coral"", ""notes"": ""WALIS reported age.""}]",17.04,17.04