65760ab105d4d80313dd96d1a45c3c597c3337956e2fa496742e94bb7dfdd277,walis_v1_0_post_review,sea_level_indicator,North coast of East Timor Laga-Buiomau (Ililai TI) - MIS 5a? - Laga-Buiomau (Ililai TI) - MIS 5a?,RSL_3652@row3012,-8.409156,126.722983,reported,0.0,23.29,MSL,reported,coral_reef,Coral reef terrace (general definition),"[-1.29, -0.8900000000000001]",73.36,u_series,"Coral reef terrace (general definition); Sample elevation which coincides with the notch elevation. This terrace is a narrow modern sandy beach that slopes steeply to a talus and plausible notch at 22 m asl. It is mainly comprised of a fluvial conglomerate. However, the notch is a contact between fluvial conglomerate and in situ coral reef of Terrace II.","North coast of East Timor Laga-Buiomau (Ililai TI) - MIS 5a?, Laga-Buiomau (Ililai TI) - MIS 5a?, N/A, East Timor","Cox, 2009 Maxwell et al., 2021",https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5979520,1.0,"WALIS quality RSL=5, age=3. Originally accepted=Yes; accepted by other study=N/A. Elevation source: Paleo RSL (m). WALIS reported age. Originally reported ID: Bui-41. Analysis ID: CO09-017-001. WALIS U-series ID: 2969. Record Created by: Kathrine Maxwell. Last Update: 2021-02-28 14:02:05.","{""page"": null, ""figure"": null, ""table"": ""WALIS Summary.csv"", ""section"": ""RSL_3652@row3012"", ""quote_or_paraphrase"": ""WALIS row RSL_3652: Sea Level Indicator; Coral reef terrace (general definition); elevation 22.2 m; paleo RSL 23.29 m; dating U-Series.""}","{""reported_elevation_m"": 22.2, ""reported_depth_m"": null, ""reported_datum"": ""Mean Sea Level / General definition"", ""reported_uncertainty_m"": 0.53}","{""raw_raster_value_m"": null, ""applied_correction_m"": null, ""derived_elevation_m"": 23.29, ""derived_depth_m"": null, ""derivation_notes"": ""WALIS Paleo RSL used as LITTORAL analytical elevation when available; measured indicator elevation preserved as reported observation.""}","[{""method"": ""u_series"", ""relation"": ""equal"", ""age_ka"": 73.